#ASSERT `ind G6 examine` (`the Agencies' reading under Guideline 6 of` (`ind G6 facts` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`ind G6 examine` (`the Agencies' reading under Guideline 6 of` (`ind G6 facts` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE)))
-- [S7] footnote 37: nascent threats acquired by non-dominant firms are assessed under the other Guidelines.
#ASSERT `ind G6 nascent` (`the Agencies' reading under Guideline 6 of` (`ind G6 facts` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE)) EQUALS `under the other Guidelines, the acquirer not being dominant`
#ASSERT `ind G6 nascent` (`the Agencies' reading under Guideline 6 of` (`ind G6 facts` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE)) EQUALS `under Guideline 6, the acquirer being dominant`
#ASSERT `ind G6 nascent` (`the Agencies' reading under Guideline 6 of` (`ind G6 facts` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE)) EQUALS `no nascent competitive threat is acquired`

§§ `I. Guidelines 7 to 11: 2.7 [pdf pages 23 and 24 of 51]; 2.8 [pdf page 24]; 2.9 [pdf pages 24 to 27]; 2.10 [pdf pages 27 and 28]; 2.11 [pdf pages 29 and 30]`

