#ASSERT elem `competition on a platform` (`the platform competition Guideline 9 examines` `a platform operator that is also a participant merging with a firm whose product is offered on the platform`)
#ASSERT elem `competition to displace a platform` (`the platform competition Guideline 9 examines` `a merger affecting a firm or service that could displace the platform or one of its services`)

