GIVETH A `Platform facts`
`ind platform facts` MEANS `Platform facts` WITH
    `what the merger involves` IS involves
    `the platform cannot make a sale to one side without simultaneously making a sale to the other` IS transaction

GIVEN f IS A `Platform finding`
