`ind G11 facts` MEANS `Guideline 11 facts` WITH
    `the kinds of partial ownership the acquisition involves` IS LIST `cross-ownership: a non-controlling interest in a competitor`
    `the effects of the partial acquisition the evidence shows` IS LIST `a reduced incentive of the acquirer to compete`

GIVEN f IS A `Guideline 11 finding`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`ind G11 examine` MEANS f's `the Agencies examine the partial acquisition under the frameworks of Guidelines 1 to 6`

